   "title": "The Basket-Mender's Due",
   "turnin": "r20_elf_start_cook",
   "xp": 60
  },
  {
   "copper": 6,
   "description": "Every spring we sow for a forest; every spring the foxes discover our generosity. Cull eight Young Foxes by day in the Silverleaf Foxglades, which lie in the east of Silverleaf Glades. Mind the Aggressive Boars nearby: a red name means the creature may start the fight itself.",
   "giver": "r14_elf_elder",
   "giver_name": "Saelin Dewbough",
   "giver_settlement": "Silverleaf",
