   "title": "Enough for the Latecomers",
   "turnin": "r20_elf_start_cook",
   "xp": 100
  },
  {
   "copper": 4,
   "description": "Even an ancient recipe needs someone willing to get their boots wet. By day, bring me two Crab Legs from the Small Crabs on the Silverleaf Strand, which lies in the south of Silverleaf Glades. Their yellow names mean they will not attack first. Keep any Crab Eyes for an enchanter; I prefer supper to stop watching me.",
   "giver": "r20_elf_start_cook",
   "giver_name": "Liora Dewpot",
