   ],
   "title": "The Third Metal",
   "turnin": "r14_elf_elder",
   "xp": 130
  },
  {
   "copper": 10,
   "description": "Those clean cuts lead to the Silverleaf Poacher Camp east from here, occupied day and night by Confused Poachers and Confused Wood Thieves. Defeat seven of them in all, then their leader, Confused Poacher Chief Twig; draw him apart from his guards if you can. He sees a week's firewood where we planted a century of shade.",
